<DocsLayout title="Install Flynt" description="Install Flynt 0.12.x on macOS.">
  <h1>Install</h1><p class="lead">The primary 0.12.x distribution path is macOS artifacts from GitHub Releases.</p>
  <h2>macOS</h2><ul><li><strong>PKG:</strong> preferred for direct installation and local update validation.</li><li><strong>DMG:</strong> open and drag <code>Flynt.app</code> to Applications.</li></ul>
  <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/styrene-lab/flynt/releases/latest">Download latest release</a></p>
  <h2>Omegon runtime</h2><p>The embedded agent panel checks for a compatible local <code>omegon</code> binary and project-scoped Flynt agent extension. If setup is incomplete, use <strong>Settings → Omegon → Runtime</strong> or the panel preflight card.</p>
</DocsLayout>
